  "title": "CMake: Set MSYS2 default install prefix",
  "description": "The WSDG claims that `ninja install` will install to the MSYS2\nshell path. To do that, we have to set the CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX\nin case of default, so that things install to the /ucrt environment\nor wherever, instead of installing to Program Files\\wireshark.\n\nCalling ninja install sets up all the various directories as in\na POSIX-style structure (bin, lib, etc.), unlike when using NSIS\nto create an installer that uses the same paths as a normal build.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
